    "title": "From the order system and the courier app to the late-delivery feature tables, daily and in real time",
    "subtitle": "LastLeg Logistics data platform, EDAI-1: the steps, the zones they write and the services around them",
    "description": "Each batch step writes one zone of the lakehouse, and the next step reads it from there. The stream counts the deliveries per hub in 5-minute windows. Airflow runs the batch steps, DataHub records their lineage and validation results, and the storage servers hold every zone.",
